OL,3,GNEWSANew MHKs to be sworn into House of
OL,4,AKeys
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwenty-four MHKs are to be formally
OL,7,Fsworn in as members of the Manx
OL,8,Fparliament later at a special sitting
OL,9,Fof the House of Keys, following the
OL,10,Fgeneral election.
OL,12,FNine of the 24 have been re-elected,
OL,13,Fwhile the remaining majority of 15, are
OL,14,Ffirst-time politicians.
OL,16,FThe swearing-in ceremony will take
OL,17,Fplace from 11:30 BST, and later at
OL,18,F14:30 a speaker and deputy speaker of
OL,19,Fthe house will be elected by their
OL,20,Fpeers.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
