OL,3,GNEWSANew MHKs to be sworn into House of
OL,4,AKeys
OL,5,
OL,6,FEach new member has the choice of
OL,7,Ftaking an official oath of allegiance
OL,8,For making a solemn affirmation - done
OL,9,Fin either English or Manx Gaelic - and
OL,10,Fthey cannot take their seats in the
OL,11,Fchamber until they are officially sworn
OL,12,Fin.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
